WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.718
This is VaultBorn.

2
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.322
Start with one castle. Grow it into a kingdom.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.299
Then choose who leads your army.

4
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.338
Replay any raid, exchange by exchange.

5
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.917
Stake BCH. Your rival matches it.

6
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.529
Win, and both stakes are yours.

7
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.828
Sign in with your wallet. Nothing moves until you approve.

8
00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:35.231
Half of every payment lands in your own War Chest.

9
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:39.470
Forge alliances. Chase the season's prize pool.

10
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.693
And it's already live.

11
00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.548
VaultBorn. A kingdom is earned.
